# The drawn steering lean (entity+0x854, FUN_0883fab4's second filter) against
# each of its inputs: the stick, each airbrake alone, the stick with either
# airbrake, and both airbrakes. Each airbrake is pressed once and held, never
# tapped twice inside the sideshift window, so the sideshift terms stay clear.
#
#     just trace --port <port> --script verification/scenarios/steer-lean-airbrakes.inputs \
#         --script-lead 2 --warmup-hold cross --warmup 6 \
#         --out data/traces/talons-junction-steer-lean-airbrakes.csv
#
# Reference scenario: Time Trial, Venom, Talon's Junction White, Assegai.

60 cross
120 cross stick_x=1.0
60 cross
120 cross l
60 cross
120 cross r
60 cross
120 cross stick_x=1.0 r
60 cross
120 cross stick_x=1.0 l
60 cross
120 cross l r
60 cross
